{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07744","headline":"寄赵正字 · 孟浩然","name":"寄赵正字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"正字芸香阁，幽人竹素园。\n经过宛如昨，归卧寂无喧。\n高鸟能择木，羚羊漫触藩。\n物情今已见，从此愿忘言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07744.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07744","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}